  "portal_description": "NetworkManager is a system network service that manages network devices and connections, attempting to keep active network connectivity when available. Its capabilities include managing Ethernet, wireless, mobile broadband (WWAN), and PPPoE devices, as well as providing VPN integration with a variety of different VPN services.\n\nBug Fix(es):\n\n* Cannot use interface name with 15+ length for OVS DPDK interface [rhel-9.4.z] (JIRA:RHEL-60249)\n\n* Bond port not activated automatically on boot [rhel-9.4.z] (JIRA:RHEL-65006)",
